      trade="Landscape Distribution"
      content="Most commercial sod farms do not break pallets. If your yard requires 4.2 pallets, you must decide between buying 4 pallets (and risking being 90 square feet short on the last day) or buying 5 full pallets. Always buy 5 pallets. Being short means paying another $100 to $175 residential delivery drop fee for a single pallet, which may arrive days later from a different harvest lot with noticeably different grass blade texture or color."
